{"id":"3b381d4fd8c0816a","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-measure11-positive-measure-algebra.md","title":"ZFC Measure11 Positive Measure Algebra","display":"df-zfc-measure11-positive-measure-algebra — ZFC Measure11 Positive Measure Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure11-positive-measure-algebra","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure11-positive-measure-algebra"],"display":"df-zfc-measure11-positive-measure-algebra — ZFC Measure11 Positive Measure Algebra","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure11-measure-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure11-positive-measure-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure11-positive-measure-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure11-positive-measure-algebra — ZFC Measure11 Positive Measure Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40617012e3a2a78d\" href=\"?note=40617012e3a2a78d\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure11-measure-algebra\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure11-measure-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\Sigma,\\mu\\in V\">\\(P,\\Sigma,\\mu\\in V\\)</span> (positive quotient, measurable sets, and measure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MeasureAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MeasureAlgebra}_S\\)</span> (canonical measure-algebra quotient predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11PositiveMeasureAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11PositiveMeasureAlgebra}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11PositiveMeasureAlgebra}_S(P,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\mathbb B\\;\\exists E\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MeasureAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\Sigma,\\mu,E)\\land P=\\{c\\in\\mathbb B:\\exists A\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\mu(A)&gt;0\\land c=\\{B\\in\\Sigma:\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in E\\})\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11PositiveMeasureAlgebra}_S(P,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\mathbb B\\;\\exists E\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MeasureAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\Sigma,\\mu,E)\\land P=\\{c\\in\\mathbb B:\\exists A\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\mu(A)&gt;0\\land c=\\{B\\in\\Sigma:\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in E\\})\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The null-equivalence relation and full quotient are supplied by the canonical measure-algebra predicate; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> is precisely its positive part.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure11-measure-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"40617012e3a2a78d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure11-measure-algebra]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\Sigma,\\mu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MeasureAlgebra}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11PositiveMeasureAlgebra}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}positive\\text{-}measure\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11PositiveMeasureAlgebra}_S(P,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\mathbb B\\;\\exists E\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MeasureAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\Sigma,\\mu,E)\\land P=\\{c\\in\\mathbb B:\\exists A\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\mu(A)>0\\land c=\\{B\\in\\Sigma:\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in E\\})\\}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":1229,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2563","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-measure11-positive-measure-algebra.md|58-df-zfc-measure11-positive-measure-algebra]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["40617012e3a2a78d"]}